<header class="hero"><div class="hero-in"><div class="eyebrow">STRATIC MARKET · TRUST &amp; TRANSPARENCY</div><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>This policy explains what information Stratic Market handles, why it is used, how seller payment details are separated, and the choices available to buyers and sellers.</p><div class="meta"><span>Effective date: 30 October 2026</span><span>Language: English</span><span>Document: Privacy notice</span></div></div></header>
<div class="wrap">
<aside class="toc"><b>POLICY CONTENTS</b><nav>
